1
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:40,460
Hearing rumors that a witch who kidnapped children and drank their blood lived in the woods outside town, Mokku ventured into the forest out of morbid curiosity.

2
00:01:43,424 --> 00:01:47,160
There, he met the gentle-looking Countess Leonard.

3
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:56,120
Unaware she was a vampire in disguise, Mokku even fawned over her and begged her to be his mother.

4
00:01:59,009 --> 00:02:04,920
Starving for the fresh blood of children, the vampire ordered Mokku to return to town and bring back a friend.

5
00:02:06,505 --> 00:02:19,840
Without suspecting a thing, Mokku set off for town to invite his girlfriend. Next, I'll put it into these three bases. Something's missing.

6
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:32,440
Something's missing. Something's missing.

7
00:02:52,990 --> 00:02:57,320
Mokku is already dead. He can't possibly come back.

8
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,540
Mokku!

9
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,480
Mokku!

10
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:23,300
Mokku!

11
00:03:23,301 --> 00:03:24,760
You're back!

12
00:03:26,364 --> 00:03:29,160
I'm so glad you came back safe and sound!

13
00:03:31,830 --> 00:03:33,640
What is it? What's the matter?

14
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:39,060
Cheer up! You're a boy, aren't you!

15
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:10,336
Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! Grand—

16
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:16,360
Mokku, won't you dance with me? Come on, come on, let's dance, let's dance! Thank goodness, thank goodness! Grandpa is so happy.

17
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:25,980
Look, Mokku, won't you dance? Thank goodness, thank goodness. Truly, thank goodness! Grandpa is so happy. Thank goodness, thank goodness.

18
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:32,420
Mokku, stay with me!

19
00:04:33,110 --> 00:04:34,640
I want to sleep...

20
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:42,640
There, there. You must be exhausted. Let's get some sleep, let's go to sleep.

21
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:51,920
Poor thing, suffering so much to end up like this...

22
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:07,720
Come on, get some rest. I'll sleep beside you.

23
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:51,900
Please rest a little longer...

24
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:57,220
I'll be waiting. Be sure to bring back some good children.

25
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,800
Ready yet?

26
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:16,980
Not yet.

27
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,960
Ready yet?

28
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,860
Ready!

29
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,660
Don't get in my way!

30
00:06:29,925 --> 00:06:31,020
Want to go to a castle?

31
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:32,540
A castle?

32
00:06:32,895 --> 00:06:37,360
Lady White Sparrow said we could come. It's a wonderful place.

33
00:06:38,105 --> 00:06:41,080
I've never heard of a castle around here.

34
00:06:41,615 --> 00:06:43,100
I'm the only one who knows.

35
00:06:52,020 --> 00:06:54,980
If you want to play, wait there and I'll let you in.

36
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,540
Ready yet?

37
00:06:58,385 --> 00:07:00,000
Ready.

38
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:05,000
It's true. I made a promise to Countess Leonard.

39
00:07:06,140 --> 00:07:06,840
Promised what?

40
00:07:07,105 --> 00:07:11,180
That I'd bring you all. You're my friends, aren't you?

41
00:07:11,835 --> 00:07:13,920
Please, come with me.

42
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,640
Huh?

43
00:08:07,730 --> 00:08:10,620
It's a promise. Take it off here.

44
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:13,600
Why do we have to take off our crosses?

45
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:19,220
Because there are no schools or churches at the castle. We won't need anything like that.

46
00:08:20,250 --> 00:08:27,300
That's strange... / You're the strange ones. What's the point of searching for something like that? It's completely useless.

47
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:32,059
Talk like that is how Rino and Marco got killed by wolves!

48
00:08:32,525 --> 00:08:36,559
Heh, damn it! I made it back, didn't I? Look!

49
00:08:38,819 --> 00:08:43,700
There's no helping it. If we don't go, Mokku will break his promise.

50
00:08:59,779 --> 00:09:00,779
Let's go!

51
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,720
Come back!

52
00:10:09,419 --> 00:10:13,820
Someone clearly saw your Mokku taking those kids away!

53
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,940
Old man, what are you going to do about this?!

54
00:10:17,569 --> 00:10:21,320
That place is terrifying—even grown men only dare go as far as the edge of the forest!

55
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,580
The woods are deep, and they say it's crawling with starving wolves!

56
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:28,280
It's all your fault for making a wooden puppet like that!

57
00:10:30,005 --> 00:10:34,240
I am truly sorry... / An apology won't fix this!

58
00:10:34,985 --> 00:10:36,920
What are you going to do about my child?!

59
00:10:37,855 --> 00:10:40,520
Bring Rosanna back here right now!

60
00:10:40,965 --> 00:10:45,040
Even if you say that... / If Sophia dies like Rino and Marco did...

61
00:10:45,609 --> 00:10:47,260
...you'll pay for this!

62
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:54,900
All I can do is find another oak tree and carve a puppet.

63
00:10:55,105 --> 00:10:57,840
But I can never make another puppet like Mokku again.

64
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:01,600
You've got to be joking! An evil puppet like that...

65
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:08,060
Listen to me. If Anna and the others don't come back safely, you're getting kicked out of this village!

66
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:29,560
Please rest a little longer.

67
00:11:32,275 --> 00:11:35,620
Mokku, what have you done?

68
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:37,880
What am I supposed to do?

69
00:11:38,530 --> 00:11:40,520
Mokku really is a bad boy.

70
00:11:40,945 --> 00:11:42,580
Making Grandfather suffer like this.

71
00:11:48,389 --> 00:11:52,040
Huh? What is Grandfather planning to do?

72
00:12:00,395 --> 00:12:03,460
Ah! Ah! Ugh! Ouch!

73
00:12:04,089 --> 00:12:06,760
Grandfather! You can't go into the Demon Forest alone!

74
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:44,860
Good night.

75
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:49,280
Now then, come to my room. / Yes!

76
00:12:57,529 --> 00:13:01,160
Mokku, starting tonight, you'll sleep in Rufus's room.

77
00:13:01,855 --> 00:13:04,040
Mama, but why...

78
00:13:06,304 --> 00:13:08,540
You said you'd be my mama!

79
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:18,600
The Countess only sleeps with human children.

80
00:13:29,179 --> 00:13:31,280
Where did Rufus go?

81
00:13:32,185 --> 00:13:35,640
I really don't want to sleep all alone in a room like this.

82
00:13:39,119 --> 00:13:45,500
Rufus went to suck the blood of horses and cows, and Countess Leonard went to suck Anna's blood.

83
00:13:45,939 --> 00:13:48,940
Who's there?! Come out! You won't get away with lying to me!

84
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:53,060
Mokku, have you forgotten my voice?

85
00:13:54,619 --> 00:13:57,860
The Oak Tree Fairy...

86
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:08,940
Madame Leonard really is 521 years old.

87
00:14:09,975 --> 00:14:11,620
You heard it yourself, didn't you?

88
00:14:14,429 --> 00:14:17,980
Madame Leonard stays alive by drinking the blood of living human children.

89
00:14:18,595 --> 00:14:23,280
That's not true! She loves children, and she said she'd be my mama!

90
00:14:23,965 --> 00:14:27,800
Grandfather is worried sick. Hurry and save Anna and the others.

91
00:14:28,810 --> 00:14:30,880
But Anna and the others came on their own...

92
00:14:32,849 --> 00:14:36,500
You brought Anna and the others here just so you could live an easy life playing around.

93
00:14:38,315 --> 00:14:43,000
That's not true! I love studying, and I love going to church and listening to sermons!

94
00:14:47,709 --> 00:14:53,980
My nose... My nose is growing! Whenever you lie in front of me, your nose will only keep growing longer.

95
00:14:54,704 --> 00:14:57,860
No, I hate this! Please do something!

96
00:14:59,430 --> 00:15:01,520
I look ridiculous with a nose like this!

97
00:15:01,685 --> 00:15:04,740
What is truly shameful is your ugly heart.

98
00:15:07,019 --> 00:15:13,100
You may not yet have a righteous or kind heart, but you surely have courage.

99
00:15:13,539 --> 00:15:17,940
Now, if you understand what I have said, go to Madame Leonard's room.

100
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,380
And then you must save Anna and the others.

101
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:39,060
Mokku, only by overcoming hardship and suffering can you become a real human. I pray that day comes as soon as possible.

102
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:50,760
To preserve this beautiful body forever, I will keep drinking the blood of sweet children like you.

103
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,820
A being as beautiful as I has earned that right.

104
00:15:57,510 --> 00:15:59,820
I'll keep using that lazy Mokku...

105
00:16:00,294 --> 00:16:02,680
...to bring me lovely children like you...

106
00:16:02,879 --> 00:16:04,980
...and drain every drop of your blood.

107
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,860
First, I'll take Anna's blood.

108
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:24,000
The other two can cower and watch.

109
00:16:37,829 --> 00:16:39,020
You damn vampire!

110
00:16:51,629 --> 00:16:54,240
Sophia and Rosanne were turned into tiny dwarfs!

111
00:16:56,489 --> 00:16:59,160
It's not my fault!

112
00:17:03,509 --> 00:17:08,440
There was nothing I could do! I've become the vampire's henchman!

113
00:17:28,409 --> 00:17:30,180
I'm so sad.

114
00:17:30,769 --> 00:17:33,000
I hate vampires.

115
00:17:36,829 --> 00:17:38,640
What's going to happen to me now?

116
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:52,080
Mokku!

117
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:54,780
Mokku!

118
00:17:56,004 --> 00:17:58,140
What's wrong? Mokku, pull yourself together!

119
00:18:00,689 --> 00:18:02,780
I'm here now, so you have nothing to fear.

120
00:18:03,539 --> 00:18:07,260
Grandpa, I'm the vampire's minion.

121
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:09,240
What are you talking about, Mokku?

122
00:18:10,539 --> 00:18:13,940
You are no vampire. You're Grandpa's child.

123
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:45,540
Please wait... (ringing)

124
00:18:46,369 --> 00:18:47,960
It's a miracle!

125
00:18:47,961 --> 00:18:48,961
(No audio)

126
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,760
(Sound of peeing)

127
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:13,100
Mokku!

128
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,740
We did it!

129
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:17,580
Mokku, it's all right now!

130
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:24,020
Y-You're... d-dwarfs...

131
00:19:25,209 --> 00:19:26,360
What happened to me?

132
00:19:27,349 --> 00:19:32,020
We were children just like you who hated school and church.

133
00:19:32,624 --> 00:19:33,900
I can talk!

134
00:19:34,479 --> 00:19:39,640
He turned us into dwarfs so we couldn't escape, and he kept sucking our blood until we died.

135
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:41,860
How horrible!

136
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:44,620
But we have the cross now, so we'll be all right!

137
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:48,200
It won't be that easy.

138
00:19:48,594 --> 00:19:52,520
You geezer, how dare you barge in here.

139
00:19:54,060 --> 00:19:55,060
The cross!

140
00:19:55,259 --> 00:20:00,640
I was never human to begin with, so that useless thing won't work on me!

141
00:20:02,339 --> 00:20:03,700
I'll bite you to death!

142
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:13,000
Fire! Fire is his weakness!

143
00:20:14,620 --> 00:20:15,620
(Loud shouting)

144
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:27,020
And then...

145
00:20:32,649 --> 00:20:33,840
Ah, Mokku!

146
00:20:35,309 --> 00:20:37,880
Mokku! If you do that, your hands will...

147
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:40,020
I'll be all right!

148
00:20:40,114 --> 00:20:41,900
My hands can be fixed!

149
00:20:43,309 --> 00:20:45,820
You bastard, you wooden puppet!

150
00:20:47,904 --> 00:20:49,540
Curse you! Damn you!

151
00:21:16,609 --> 00:21:17,620
(Laughing)

152
00:21:22,419 --> 00:21:23,500
(Laughing)

153
00:21:23,860 --> 00:21:24,800
(Laughing)

154
00:21:24,801 --> 00:21:25,801
(Laughs)

155
00:21:35,079 --> 00:21:37,600
I... I'm sorry, Anna.

156
00:21:39,244 --> 00:21:40,680
Rosanda and Sophia!

157
00:21:41,329 --> 00:21:42,329
Everyone, hurry!

158
00:21:42,860 --> 00:21:43,540
Over here!

159
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:44,780
All right!

160
00:21:50,909 --> 00:21:55,060
Please help me! The cross... the cross is coming!

161
00:21:55,584 --> 00:21:58,600
Please, not the cross...

162
00:22:13,574 --> 00:22:15,100
(Screams)

163
00:22:17,349 --> 00:22:18,600
(Screams)

164
00:22:18,601 --> 00:22:19,601
(Screams)

165
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:57,161
It is the power of God... Mokku!

166
00:23:13,059 --> 00:23:20,180
The devil dwells within the human heart. If there is no devil in your heart, vampires cannot exist.

167
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Oh?

168
00:23:33,054 --> 00:23:36,200
Having overcome the terrifying devil's magic,

169
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:45,680
Mokku vows to become a good boy. But aboard the sleigh bound for a paradise of play, that vow was already gone from his heart.

170
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:57,400
A paradise where one can live just playing day after day. It was a land of sweet temptation created by the Poppy Fairy, who seeks to steal Mokku away from the Oak Tree Fairy.

171
00:23:58,479 --> 00:24:01,040
Look forward to next week's Kashi no Ki Mokku!

